---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Dashboard — Insight Hunter">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Dashboard</div>
      <h1 class="page-title">Operator overview shell.</h1>
      <div class="grid cards-3">
        <div class="card"><div class="kicker">Cash runway</div><div class="metric">8.4 mo</div><p>Example dashboard metric in the restore scaffold.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="kicker">Net margin</div><div class="metric">21%</div><p>Replace these placeholders with live data bindings once backend restore is finished.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="kicker">Alerts</div><div class="metric">3</div><p>Use this page as the dashboard entry point tied to auth and entitlement state.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
